OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe south and Central Belt
OL,6,Fmainly dry with sunny spells and the
OL,7,Fodd shower. Argyll seeing bright
OL,8,Fspells and a few showers, these
OL,9,Fbecoming more frequent later in the
OL,10,Fafternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA few showers across Argyll
OL,13,Fand the Central Belt this evening and
OL,14,Fovernight, but dry in the south. Fresh
OL,15,Fsoutherly winds along the coast,
OL,16,Foccasionally strong across Tiree later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
