OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FWidespread rain, occasionally
OL,6,Fheavy, will spread northeast during
OL,7,Fthe morning. Drier and clearer weather
OL,8,Fwill spread from the west in the
OL,9,Fafternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry
OL,12,Fwith some sunshine on Monday. Windy
OL,13,Fand mainly dry on Tuesday, but patchy
OL,14,Frain likely in the afternoon. Bright
OL,15,Fwith a few showers on Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
